hetics\",\"description\":\"Build an AI-powered theme generation system that creates custom visual themes based on report content, user preferences, or brand guidelines. Users could describe a desired mood ('professional and trustworthy' or 'urgent investigative'), and the system generates a complete theme with coordinated colors, typography, spacing, animations, and iconography. Themes could be saved, shared, and refined over time.\",\"reasoning\":\"Currently limited to two hardcoded themes (radar/swiss). A generative theme engine would create unlimited visual identities, making every report feel uniquely crafted. This could become a defining feature that attracts design-conscious users and enterprises wanting branded reports.\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"user_feedback\":null,\"user_pattern\":0,\"effort\":null,\"impact\":null,\"risk\":null,\"requirement_id\":null,\"goal_id\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-30T00:08:50.472Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-01-30T00:08:50.472Z\",\"implemented_at\":null}}\r","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false}}
