eme Marketplace with Community Creation Tools\",\"description\":\"Build a theme marketplace where designers can create, sell, and share custom report themes. Include a visual theme editor with real-time preview, component customization down to animation curves, and theme inheritance for creating variations. Themes could be industry-specific (legal, financial, investigative), mood-based, or branded for enterprise. Revenue sharing creates a creator economy around report aesthetics.\",\"reasoning\":\"The current two-theme approach limits personalization. A marketplace would create network effects - every new theme makes the platform more valuable. This transforms theming from a feature into a platform, attracting designers and creating defensible differentiation through community contributions.\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"user_feedback\":null,\"user_pattern\":0,\"effort\":null,\"impact\":null,\"risk\":null,\"requirement_id\":null,\"goal_id\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-30T00:09:11.997Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-01-30T00:09:11.997Z\",\"implemented_at\":null}}\r","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false}}
[2026-01-30T00:09:25.018Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01Fu6kud2jYxnbG2PQjy9rZ1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've completed the moonshot idea generation for the Report Theming & Cards context.\n\n**Summary: Moonshot Ideas for Report Theming & Cards Context**\n\nCreated 5 moonshot ideas for the Report Theming & Cards context (ctx_1769727798577_zneo2y1):\n\n1. **Generative Theme Engine with AI-Designed Aesthetics** - AI-powered system that creates custom visual themes based on content, user preferences, or brand guidelines. Describe a mood and get a complete coordinated theme.\n\n2. **Living Cards with Real-Time Data Streams** - Transform static stat cards into living visualizations connected to real-time data streams with heartbeat animations, decay indicators, and trend microcharts.\n\n3. **Spatial 3D Report Environments** - Create immersive 3D report environments where users navigate through their research like a museum, with VR support and spatial metaphors.\n\n4. **Emotional Intelligence Layer for Visual Components** - Add emotional meaning to every card and badge - pulsing for upward trends, dimming for stale data, glowing for controversy. Create a vocabulary of visual emotions.\n\n5. **Theme Marketplace with Community Creation Tools** - Build a marketplace for designers to create, sell, and share custom report themes with a visual editor and revenue sharing.\n\n**Observations about the Report Theming & Cards codebase:**\n- Well-structured dual-theme system (radar/swiss) with clean separation via ThemeContext\n- Good use of Framer Motion for animations (AnimatedNumber, AnimatedProgressRing)\n- Shared components (Cards, Badges, ProgressBar, Icons) provide a solid foundation\n- ThemedCards.tsx shows the pattern for theme-aware components that could be extended\n- Current implementation is solid but limited to two fixed themes - significant potential for expansion"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3850,"cache_read_input_tokens":65228,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3850},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05d3e4f1-2259-4f3e-a055-8040a34c8b02","uuid":"e974cfa3-14a1-4267-b01e-0f4bed10faf3"}
[2026-01-30T00:09:25.021Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":80208,"duration_api_ms":81610,"num_turns":15,"result":"I've completed the moonshot idea generation for the Report Theming & Cards context.\n\n**Summary: Moonshot Ideas for Report Theming & Cards Context**\n\nCreated 5 moonshot ideas for the Report Theming & Cards context (ctx_1769727798577_zneo2y1):\n\n1. **Generative Theme Engine with AI-Designed Aesthetics** - AI-powered system that creates custom visual themes based on content, user preferences, or brand guidelines. Describe a mood and get a complete coordinated theme.\n\n2. **Living Cards with Real-Time Data Streams** - Transform static stat cards into living visualizations connected to real-time data streams with heartbeat animations, decay indicators, and trend microcharts.\n\n3. **Spatial 3D Report Environments** - Create immersive 3D report environments where users navigate through their research like a museum, with VR support and spatial metaphors.\n\n4. **Emotional Intelligence Layer for Visual Components** - Add emotional meaning to every card and badge - pulsing for upward trends, dimming for stale data, glowing for controversy. Create a vocabulary of visual emotions.\n\n5. **Theme Marketplace with Community Creation Tools** - Build a marketplace for designers to create, sell, and share custom report themes with a visual editor and revenue sharing.\n\n**Observations about the Report Theming & Cards codebase:**\n- Well-structured dual-theme system (radar/swiss) with clean separation via ThemeContext\n- Good use of Framer Motion for animations (AnimatedNumber, AnimatedProgressRing)\n- Shared components (Cards, Badges, ProgressBar, Icons) provide a solid foundation\n- ThemedCards.tsx shows the pattern for theme-aware components that could be extended\n- Current implementation is solid but limited to two fixed themes - significant potential for expansion","session_id":"05d3e4f1-2259-4f3e-a055-8040a34c8b02"